LangString HeiranUpgradePrompt ${LANG_ENGLISH} "$1 is already installed.$\r$\n$\r$\nDo you want to uninstall the old version before installing the new one?"
LangString HeiranUninstallFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The previous version could not be uninstalled."
LangString HeiranApplicationDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "The viewer and the libraries it needs."
LangString HeiranAssociationHrnName ${LANG_ENGLISH} ".hrn (Heiran session)"
LangString HeiranAssociationHrnDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open .hrn session files with Heiran. No other application uses this extension."
LangString HeiranAssociationImageName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Common image formats"
LangString HeiranAssociationImageDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Offer Heiran in Open with for PNG, JPEG, BMP, GIF, WebP, AVIF, JPEG XL, PSD and TIFF. The current default application is not changed."
LangString HeiranAssociationHdrName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "High precision formats"
LangString HeiranAssociationHdrDescription ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Offer Heiran in Open with for EXR, HDR, DPX and TGA. The current default application is not changed."
